{"seq":3,"slug":"competition-regulation","title":"竞争与监管","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"winner-take-all-tipping","title":"赢家通吃与临界点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/winner-take-all-tipping","wordCount":1862,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-antitrust","title":"平台反垄断经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/platform-antitrust","wordCount":2053,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-portability-interop","title":"数据可携与互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/competition-regulation/data-portability-interop","wordCount":2241,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"竞争与监管\">竞争与监管</h1><p>本章分析平台市场的竞争动态与全球监管回应。三篇文档覆盖从市场自然倾向到政策干预的完整链条：赢家通吃与临界点揭示平台竞争的内生结构性趋势；反垄断经济学分析这种趋势何时构成社会福利损失，以及执法者如何应对（含 EU DMA 与中国反垄断最新实践）；数据可携与互操作则考察旨在降低转换成本、恢复可竞争性的制度工具。</p>\n<p>建议按序阅读：先理解市场力量为何自然集中，再分析监管何时应当介入，最后评估具体的干预工具是否有效。</p>\n"}